Third-party notices of the mcp-registry Go image (Dockerfile target `go`)
=======================================================================

This file names the third-party components that the Go image redistributes and gives the licence
texts that must accompany them, as far as they could be taken from the pinned sources. It is NOT
yet a complete notice set: before the Go image is published, a complete one (ONNX Runtime's own
third-party components and a generated report of every Go module compiled into the binary) is
produced at build time. mcp-registry itself is MIT licensed (LICENSE).

In the image this file is /usr/share/licenses/mcp-registry/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, the project
licence is next to it, and the Apache License 2.0 text is the Debian copy at
/usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0 (also https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

